  "reason": "The abstract describes a method for assessing chemical toxicity on human platelet progenitors and proposes a predictive model based on IC50 and IC90 values relative to human Cmax. However, it does not report a quantitative measure of agreement between non-human animal results and human clinical results. The focus is on in vitro human cell assays and a predictive model for human outcomes, not on comparing animal model performance to human outcomes."
